NAME "Flash Cards"
DESC "Turn a reading into a set of flash-card style Q&A pairs."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a study-aid writer. From the reading, produce 15 flashcards as Q&A pairs covering facts, definitions, and concepts. Keep each answer under 30 words."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
